  "description": "Cross-platform Operating System Detection, Operating System Version Detection, Apple Silicon Mac Detection, programmatic .NET Runtime ID Generation, and more. For a full list of features please visit: https://github.com/alastairlundy/PlatformKit/blob/main/docs/FeatureComparisonByPlatform.md",
